  npcName: Odd Ant
  lines:
  - text: Oi! Young Blood, what'cha loitering so high around my hidie hole?!
    portrait: {fileID: 7198809015613602317, guid: 278bcb241cd705b41bd7cdd5a2615b66, type: 3}
  - text: Don't you go drilling me out that I ain't working, YOU're in no better
      position than ME.
    portrait: {fileID: -2249631188897383861, guid: 278bcb241cd705b41bd7cdd5a2615b66, type: 3}
  - text: Now Scram.
    portrait: {fileID: 2428041468874453082, guid: 278bcb241cd705b41bd7cdd5a2615b66, type: 3}
  - text: ...
    portrait: {fileID: 7057801135558962131, guid: 278bcb241cd705b41bd7cdd5a2615b66, type: 3}
